{"story_id":74818,"updated_at":"2026-11-12T23:14:32","headline_en":"India beats Afghanistan by eight wickets to reach U19 Asia Cup final","headline_hi":"भारत ने अफगानिस्तान को आठ विकेट से हराकर अंडर-19 एशिया कप के फाइनल में प्रवेश किया","payload_en":{"story_id":74818,"headline":"India beats Afghanistan by eight wickets to reach U19 Asia Cup final","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":2,"outlets":2},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["The Hindu","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":67949,"parents":[{"story_id":68625,"headline":"India U-19 team loses Asia Cup match after scoring 208 runs"}],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-12T23:14:32","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life"],"tertiary":["sport-films"]},"places":[],"people":["Lakshya Raichandani","Afghanistan","Mohammad Ali","Pakistan","VK Vineeth","Amir Hamza","Aryan Savsani","Noor Ali Niazi"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"India Under-19 defeated Afghanistan Under-19 by eight wickets in the ACC Men's U19 Asia Cup 2026 semifinal on Thursday 12 November 2026.","ids":[126194],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"On 8 November, Hasnain Dar scored 38 runs and partnered with Hamza Zahoor for 107 runs, while Skipper Lakshya Raichandani (0), Aryavir Sehwag (22), VK Vineeth (8), Yashbardhan Chauhan (1), and Anvay Dravid (10) failed to get substantial runs.","ids":[-112993,-112994],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"Pakistan pacers Ali Raza, Rizwanullah and spinner Niqab Shafiq claimed three wickets each, and they sit atop the Group A points table in the ACC Men's U19 Asia Cup 2026.","ids":[-112996,-112997],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"On Thursday 12 November 2026, India reached the target in 36.5 overs, finishing at 230/2.","ids":[126184,126195],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"Raichandani was dismissed after scooping the ball to Mohammad Ali.","ids":[126185],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"On Thursday 12 November 2026, Afghanistan reached 227/8 in 50 overs.","ids":[126196],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"They won the toss and elected to bat.","ids":[126198],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Raichandani scored an unbeaten 93.","ids":[126201],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Raichandani struck 93 runs in the Under-19 Asia Cup semifinal on Thursday.","ids":[126180],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Aryan Savsani dismissed Amir Hamza and Tahir Sarwary in the same over.","ids":[126199],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"VK Vineeth finished the contest with a six off Noor Ali Niazi.","ids":[126200],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Raichandani's first fifty came off 39 balls.","ids":[126189],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Noman Salarzai and Shah Faisal Rahimi each scored 51 runs.","ids":[126205],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Ishan Sood took 3 wickets for 43 runs, and Sohail Khan took 1 wicket for 56 runs.","ids":[126202,126210],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Niazi took 1 wicket for 58 runs, and Savsani took 2 wickets for 29 runs.","ids":[126211,126209],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"VK Vineeth remained unbeaten on 57 runs, and Sehwag scored 51 runs off 57 balls.","ids":[126207,126208],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"On Thursday 12 November 2026, India would face Pakistan in the U19 Asia Cup final, which was scheduled for 14 November 2026.","ids":[126193,126187],"parts":[{"text":"On Thursday 12 November 2026, India would face Pakistan in the U19 Asia Cup final,","ids":[126193],"class":"unverified"},{"text":"which was scheduled for 14 November 2026.","ids":[126187],"class":"single"}],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"They would play Pakistan in the final on Saturday.","ids":[126212],"class":"single","sources":[1]}]],"section_keys":["news","background","happened","happened","performers","performers","performers","numbers","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/cricket/news/lakshya-raichandanis-93-powers-india-u19-to-eight-wicket-semifinal-win-over-afghanistan-sets-up-blockbuster-final-against-pakistan/articleshow/135768235.cms","outlet":"Times of India","title":"Raichandani's 93 powers India U19 to 8-wicket semifinal win over Afghanistan","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/u19-asia-cup-raichandanis-93-sees-india-to-final-to-face-pakistan-in-title-clash/article71695309.ece","outlet":"The Hindu","title":"U19 Asia Cup: Raichandani’s 93 sees India to final, to face Pakistan in title clash","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":3,"url":"https://www.aninews.in/news/sports/cricket/hamza-zahoors-unbeaten-ton-guides-pakistan-to-3-wicket-win-over-india-in-acc-mens-u19-asia-cup-202620261108191540","outlet":"","title":"","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true}],"other_coverage":[{"text":"Pakistan defeated Bangladesh by nine wickets to book their berth in the summit clash.","ids":[126182],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Rizwanullah took five wickets for 30 runs in the semifinal between Pakistan and Bangladesh.","ids":[126186],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Pakistan defeated India in the group stages of the Under-19 Asia Cup.","ids":[126188],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Rizwanullah has 11 wickets across four matches in the tournament.","ids":[126191],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Pacer Ishan Sood took three wickets for 43 runs against Afghanistan.","ids":[126192],"class":"single","sources":[2]}]},"timeline":[],"undated":[],"established":[],"contested":[{"text":"VK Vineeth remained unbeaten on 57 runs","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":2,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/u19-asia-cup-raichandanis-93-sees-india-to-final-to-face-pakistan-in-title-clash/article71695309.ece","stance":"asser